Description
    fvConstraints for the contract case. The melt and air phases share a
    single T field, so a phase-scoped limitTemperature constraint does
    not bind; the moldingFoam energy predictor clamps T internally after
    the linear solve instead (see README section 6).
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
FoamFile
{
    format      ascii;
    class       dictionary;
    location    "system";
    object      fvConstraints;
}
